1. Removed the external DataTableProvider import
2. Created a mock DataTableContext using createContext
3. Implemented a useDataTable hook that the component needs
4. Created a MockDataTableProvider component that provides the minimum required context
5. The mock provider includes all the necessary methods and properties that the MultiSelectFilterOptions component might need
6. Updated the render section to use our MockDataTableProvider instead of the original one

This approach should resolve the import error while still providing the necessary context for the MultiSelectFilterOptions component to function properly. The mock provider implements the basic functionality needed for the component to render and operate.

